{"id":"n83008-1-13","stage":3,"title":"특수 · 特殊","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83008-1-13-1","ko":"원자력 발전소의 폐기물은 함부로 버리면 안된다면서?","zh":"听说核电站的废弃物不能随便丢弃，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"원자력","meaning":"原子能，核能","explanation":"원자력：原子能，核能","readings":[{"term":"원자력","audio":"/audio/6f3182d328a03a7ffe10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70271","senseId":"1","lemma":"원자력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원자력","audio":"/audio/6f3182d328a03a7ffe10.mp3"}},{"text":"발전소의","meaning":"发电厂，发电站","explanation":"발전소：发电厂，发电站；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"발전소","audio":"/audio/d3aceec7360eb07129e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57225","senseId":"1","lemma":"발전소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발전소의","audio":"/audio/4371208be7629f6f1608.mp3"}},{"text":"폐기물은","meaning":"废弃物","explanation":"폐기물：废弃物；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"폐기물","audio":"/audio/155f860de148fcfc5f63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83065","senseId":"1","lemma":"폐기물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폐기물은","audio":"/audio/7d055ba5c18c6c2f0746.mp3"}},{"text":"함부로","meaning":"随意，随便，乱，大肆，恣意","explanation":"함부로：随意，随便，乱，大肆，恣意","readings":[{"term":"함부로","audio":"/audio/a57ea17b4197d3729e38.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72466","senseId":"1","lemma":"함부로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"함부로","audio":"/audio/a57ea17b4197d3729e38.mp3"}},{"text":"버리면","meaning":"扔，丢","explanation":"버리다：扔，丢；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65570","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버리면","audio":"/audio/e64396be484cc2b3717f.mp3"}},{"text":"안된다면서?","meaning":"不称心，不顺","explanation":"안되다：不称心，不顺；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"안되다","audio":"/audio/988ac8e2982c41f4e0c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entr