term":"방사능","audio":"/audio/ac6150fb8c2fd1dc34bb.mp3"}},{"text":"오염을","meaning":"污染","explanation":"오염：污染；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"오염","audio":"/audio/d12991a2ead44d71b124.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21874","senseId":"1","lemma":"오염","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오염을","audio":"/audio/8dd8bd4f364a35b34352.mp3"}},{"text":"일으킬","meaning":"惹起，引起","explanation":"일으키다：惹起，引起；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"일으키다","audio":"/audio/ab00647038d63720cd1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71697","senseId":"4","lemma":"일으키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일으킬","audio":"/audio/6212fcfe833f814f31e8.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있으니까","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으니까","audio":"/audio/29dd257269502abdc5be.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰레기들과","meaning":"垃圾","explanation":"쓰레기：垃圾；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"쓰레기","audio":"/audio/2a2c538e4d404f05e7c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29590","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰레기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰레기들과","audio":"/audio/a767a5260ccf0babaada.mp3"}},{"text":"구별되어","meaning":"被区分，被区别","explanation":"구별되다：被区分，被区别；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"구별되다","audio":"/audio/e7aff22a4b6081410afd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24114","senseId":"1","lemma":"구별되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구별되어","audio":"/audio/6d10adbb913402ee6d1f.mp3"}},{"text":"특수","meaning":"特殊，特别，特异","explanation":"특수：特殊，特别，特异","readings":[{"term":"특수","audio":"/audio/ccc0d708878f798eb60b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83008","senseId":"1","lemma":"특수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"특수","audio":"/audio/ccc0d708878f798eb60b.mp3"}},{"text":"처리가","meaning":"处理","explanation":"처리：处理；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"처리","audio":"/audio/460f7d7afc67335af5cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24930","senseId":"2","lemma":"처리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처리가","audio":"/audio/add4549b1517107be59f.mp3"}},{"text":"되어야","meaning":"必须","explanation":"되다：必须；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되어야","audio":"/audio/ef140f8ac82d665ee110.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"ac6150fb8c2fd1dc","term":"방사능","zh":"放射性","audio":"/audio/ac6150fb8c2fd1dc34bb.mp3","entryId":"57922","definition":"镭、铀等放射性元素分解为小粒子时放出对人体有害的电磁波。","pronunciation":["방ː사능"]},{"id":"d12991a2ead44d71","term":"오염","zh":"污染","audio":"/audio/d12991a2ead44d71b124.mp3","entryId":"21874","definition":"成为肮脏的状态。","pronunciation":["오ː염"]},{"id":"ab00647038d63720","term":"일으키다","zh":"惹起，引起","audio":"/audio/ab00647038d63720cd1f.mp3","entryId":"71697","definition":"引发或爆发某起事情或事件等。","pronunciation":["이르키다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"2a2c538e4d404f05","term":"쓰레기","zh":"垃圾","audio":"/audio/2a2c538e4d404f05e7c9.mp3","entryId":"29590","definition":"扫除的灰尘、不能用而扔掉的东西或丢弃的东西。","pronunciation":["쓰레기"]},{"id":"e7aff22a4b608141","term":"구별되다","zh":"被区分，被区别","audio":"/audio/e7aff22a4b6081410afd.mp3","entryId":"24114","definition":"根据性质或种类产生差异。","pronunciation":["구별되다","구별뒈다"]},{"id":"ccc0d708878f798e","term":"특수","zh":"特殊，特别，特异","audio":"/audio/ccc0d708878f798eb60b.mp3","entryId":"83008","definition":"很是与众不同。","pronunciation":["특쑤"]},{"id":"460f7d7afc67335a","term":"처리","zh":"处理","audio":"/audio/460f7d7afc67335af5cb.mp3","entryId":"24930","definition":"为获得某种结果，进行化学、物理加工。","pronunciation":["처ː리"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"必须","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某件事一定要实现。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bede35df84479e8ab9aa.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":5.665,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/di